- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{1}":[503,528],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{2}":[529,529],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{3}":[530,530],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{4}":[531,531],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{5}":[532,533],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{6}":[534,549],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{7}":[550,550],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{8}":[551,551],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{9}":[552,552],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{10}":[553,554],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setDisplayValueLang\\(String time, String style, String language\\)#{11}":[555,585],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setValue\\(String o\\)":[586,603],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - setValue\\(String o\\)#{1}":[588,603],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - subtract\\(GlideTime startTime, GlideTime endTime\\)":[604,626],"#GlideTime- Scoped#GlideTime - subtract\\(GlideTime startTime, GlideTime endTime\\)#{1}":[606,626],"#GlideTime- Scoped#Related":[627,630],"#GlideTime- Scoped#Related#{1}":[629,630]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Date and time format guidelines","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/scripts/p_GlideServerAPIs.md","line":26},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":28},{"title":"Global date and time field format","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/r_FormatDateAndTimeFields.md","line":91},{"title":"script includes","target":"c_ScriptIncludes","line":145},{"title":"getDisplayValueEx\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideTimeScopedAPI.md","line":454},{"title":"getDisplayValueLang\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideTimeScopedAPI.md","line":527},{"title":"getDisplayValueEx\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideTimeScopedAPI.md","line":527},{"title":"Script includes","target":"c_ScriptIncludes","line":629}],"metadata":{"title":"GlideTime - Scoped","description":"The GlideTime API provides methods for performing operations on GlideTime objects, such as instantiating GlideTime objects or working with GlideTime fields.Instantiates a GlideTime object with the current time.Instantiates a GlideTime object with its time starting at midnight UTC plus the passed in value.Returns the time in the specified format.Gets the time in the current user's display format and time zone.Returns the time using the current user's timezone and a specified format.Gets the display value in the current user's time zone and the internal format \\(HH:mm:ss\\).Returns the time using the current user's timezone and a specified format and language.Returns the hours part of the time using the local time zone.Returns the hours part of the time using the local time zone. The number of hours is based on a 24 hour clock.Returns the hours part of the time using the UTC time zone. The number of hours is based on a 24 hour clock.Returns the hours part of the time using the UTC time zone. The number of hours is based on a 12 hour clock. Noon and midnight are represented by 0, not 12.Returns the number of minutes using the local time zone.Returns the number of minutes in the hour based on the UTC time zone.Returns the number of seconds in the current minute.Gets the time value stored in the database by the GlideTime object in the internal format, HH:mm:ss, and the system time zone.Sets a time value using the current user's display format and time zone.Sets the time using the current user's timezone and a specified format.Sets the time using the current user's timezone and a specified format and language.Sets the time of the GlideTime object in the internal time zone.Gets the duration difference between two GlideTime object values.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_GlideTimeScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":9,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[38,41],[76,79],[83,85],[129,133],[137,139],[155,159],[203,209],[213,218],[232,236],[292,298],[302,307],[405,408],[422,426],[489,493],[497,499],[574,578],[582,584],[598,602],[617,625]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideTimeScopedAPI.md"},
